{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（11日）上午11時49分，消防處接獲多人報案，指錦上路掌牛山及井坑山一帶發生山火，火線長達30米，政府飛行服務隊派出直升機投擲水彈滅火。</p><p>今早6時，天文台已發出黃色火災危險警告，表示火災危險性頗高。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場冒出大量濃煙。（poyin_lee threads 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185959811406368768203489.jpeg/xEwc1XJD3ZiVXZrbPUW9i1rFtePY7cKlI1qeISNaniE\"/><figcaption>現場冒出大量濃煙。（poyin_lee threads 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"濃煙席捲半空。（莊展銘 JASON Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185959809078398976927845.jpeg/-un0F5SeJIYu7h5GfPcb6kcYP0YGlOsbm4H58puB-fI\"/><figcaption>濃煙席捲半空。（莊展銘 JASON Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"濃煙席捲半空。（莊展銘 JASON Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185959806477799424257341.jpeg/W4OzILN4gQ1truoan1TcS5Voh9xmup6sobaj4aG2o-E\"/><figcaption>濃煙席捲半空。（莊展銘 JASON Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T07:18:27.509247+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}